# ---------------- SelfTest_Coin.events (Task 51 Part C) ----------------
# The inactive `SelfTest_Coin` template in SelfTest.scene. `spawn SelfTest_Coin at SpawnPoint`
# clones it, the clone's own sheet runs (`when me appears` is per clone), and it cleans itself up
# so a second Play of the scene starts from an empty world.

when me appears
  set CoinSpawned to 1
  wait 0.3 seconds
  destroy me
